WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
{OP}

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:05.870
What a lovely day! I might not be late for once, either!

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:09.480
Look, shooting stars!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.070
They fell over there!

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.920
Seriously?! What were they...?

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.190
These are the shooting stars...?

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:23.730
They're more like rings than stars... and they're a matching set, too.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:27.050
Where'd they fall from, though?

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.290
Lemme take a look!

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:29.600
Huh? Oh, sure.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:30.740
Here.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.120
W-What are these?!{TLC: context. "W-What happened?!"}

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.790
Miyuki! You're gonna be late!

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.460
Good morning, Akane-chan!

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.400
Good morning-kuru!

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:55.500
Kuru.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:57.240
Kuru?

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:58.270
Huh?

00:00:58.270 --> 00:00:59.730
What am I doing there-kuru?

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:01.750
What am <i>I</i> doing there?!

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:10.110
Wait... don't tell me...

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:12.280
What's all the shoutin' about?

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:17.990
Candy and I... have changed places!

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:22.440
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:24.270
Smile Precure!

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:25.170
Let's go!

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:26.710
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:27.840
All together!

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.440
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:31.650
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:34.320
Smile Precure!

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:39.150
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:44.590
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:49.800
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:55.740
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:00.670
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:00.640
So bright!

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:05.850
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:12.290
When five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.790
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:13.950
Let's go!

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:16.660
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.590
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:24.400
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:24.970
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:26.630
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:27.770
Everybody!

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.440
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.970
Fly to the future!

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:35.480
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.650
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:39.950
Smile Precure!

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:51.260
No, no, no! They're gone!

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:56.490
{TV}Good morning! This is Morning Bird with me, Akae Tamao.{this is an advertisement for another show on TV Asahi. Yes, they're advertising it in Smile. Don't ask.}

00:02:56.490 --> 00:03:00.390
{TV}Alright then, let's run through the lineup of this morning's news.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.350
Will you stop that already-oni?!

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:06.190
Do you have to be so noisy first thing in the morning?

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:09.240
My masterpiece... my magnum opus is missing!

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:11.160
You two haven't touched it, have you?!{TLC: "X is missing" "It wasn't you two, was it?!" doesn't flow. sug. "*You two haven't touched it, have you?!" "*You two* better not have done anything to it!"}

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.760
Don't look at me-oni!

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.500
What is it you lost, exactly?

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:16.330
My rings!

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:22.860
I created an amazing pair of rings that'd switch the minds of whichever foolish people wore them...

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:29.100
I call them... "Switchrings!"

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.280
Not very imaginative-oni.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:32.410
What atrocious naming sense...

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:37.530
Oh, shut up! I know I left them on my table, but now they're gone!

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.190
Huh? Your table...

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:43.650
What are these-oni?

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:49.780
Then it was you!

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:50.690
Looks like it was you.

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.270
Huh, it was me-oni?!

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:54.430
See, she said it was you.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:57.610
Guess it was after all! I'm sorry-oni!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:02.130
You two will pay for this later!

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:06.050
I didn't even do anything!

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:07.120
{TV}Thank you very much for that!

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:12.780
{TV}An unusual story if ever there was one, but we'll keep you posted.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.090
{TV}Anyway, on to our next story.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.220
I know, right?

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:25.140
Seriously!

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:27.430
I'm Miyuki...

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.160
and I'm Candy-kuru!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.340
How very puzzling...

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:31.540
Whoa!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.600
Are we sure they're not just playing some joke on us?

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:37.700
That's what I figured at first, too.{TLC: the meaning of this line and the next is more like "That's what I figured at first, too." "But if they're faking it, they're doing a damn good job!"}

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:40.080
But if they're faking it, they're doing a dang good job! {Editor: While personally I have no problem at all with it, "damn" seems kind of out of character for akane}

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.460
That's what we've been trying to tell you!

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:46.180
Alright then, I'll prove I'm the real Candy-kuru!

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:49.530
Look closely now, everyone-kuru!

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:51.500
Ta-da!

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.090
W-What?!

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:57.330
She's definitely Candy!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.600
Ain't that something...

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.200
She's far too good at that...

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.040
Whoa, Candy! Let me try too!

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:07.400
You can do it-kuru!

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:10.420
That's it!

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:12.020
You can do it, Miyuki-chan!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.750
Hey, I think I'm getting the hang of this!

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.050
They're sure having fun.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:18.370
Well, now we're sure they changed places...

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:20.160
Do we have any idea how it happened?

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:23.130
Oh, right! Look at these!

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:25.400
These must have done it-kuru.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:29.870
We picked them up off the ground, and when we did, we swapped bodies...

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:33.140
Would removing them not solve the problem, then?

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:33.770
Nice thinking!

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.350
Ow! Ow!

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.810
I suppose that would be too easy.

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:39.070
Hey, why not try that new Décor?

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:40.280
Yeah, good idea!

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:44.340
Let's Go: Ring!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:48.060
They're so pretty-kuru!

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:51.130
How lovely! They look like wedding rings!

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:54.160
Now what?

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:57.820
Is that it?!

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:02.250
Well, now what do we do? Class is about to start...

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.760
Oh man!

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:05.730
What are we gonna do about class...?

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:08.570
I fear we may have to let Candy attend in your stead...

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:12.030
I can go to class-kuru? Yay-kuru!{TLC: sug. "Can I go to class?  Can I?  Can I?"}

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:13.510
Do you think you can manage it?

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:17.560
Of course I can-kuru! Just leave it to me-kuru!

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:20.320
Oh boy...

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:23.590
Now then, class, we're going to have a small test today.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:26.540
You gonna be okay, Candy?

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:28.480
What's a test-kuru?

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:33.730
If you wouldn't mind putting away your toy, Miss Hoshizora-san.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:36.200
R-Right! I'm sorry!

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:39.740
I-Is it me, or did that thing just move of its own accord...?

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:42.840
Miss, shouldn't we start the test?

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:45.180
There's not that much time left...

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:48.020
Oh, right, yes.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.110
What're you gonna do, Candy?!

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:55.090
I dunno, but... I'll think of something-kuru!

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:57.440
Alright, I'm in your hands.{good luck!}{TLC: for tone, sug. "Well, [you'd better] think fast!" or something.  (This line is more like "I'm in your hands.  It's not like I have any other choice.", but it's in very idiomatic Japanese that just sucks if you try to translate it literally into short, snappy English, which I'm pretty sure is why Magenta didn't bother trying to.)}{Editpr: I went with the "I'm in your hands." since it could have split meanings considering how she's literally on Miyucandy's lap :P}

00:06:57.820 --> 00:06:59.980
Alright, time's up.{TLC: sug. just "Time's up!"}

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.250
How'd it go?

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.390
Piece of cake-kuru!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:09.330
H-Hoshizora-san... would you mind explaining what this is?

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:14.140
It's Candy-kuru!

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:16.510
I drew her really well-kuru!

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:18.380
Didn't I-kuru?

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.560
Come see me in the staff room later...

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:23.350
Okay-kuru!

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:28.180
Well then, Hoshizora-san next, I think.

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:29.450
Candy, stand up!

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:33.800
Just read out what I tell you to, okay?

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.160
Got it-kuru!

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:36.260
Don't shout!

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:38.310
"I am a cat."

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.130
I am a cat.

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:42.530
But wait, I'm not a cat-kuru...

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:44.660
Don't question it, alright?

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:46.940
"I still lack a name to call my own."

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:48.560
I still lack a name to call my own.

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.410
But my name's Candy-kuru!{TLC: looks odd against the video (she's cheering) sug. just "My name's Candy!"}

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:53.790
Miss Hoshizora-san, I can't help but notice the odd way you're punctuating your sentences...

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.990
"Cru, cru...?" She's in ex<i>cru</i>ciating pain!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:59.400
Maybe you should go to the infirmary, then?

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:02.450
Infirmary? What's that-kuru?

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:05.820
She's fine, really! She'll be just fine if she gets to rest!

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:07.590
Well, if you think so...

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:08.530
I'm sure!

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:11.720
And done-kuru!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.450
What exactly is this meant to be, Miss Hoshizora-san?

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:16.570
It's the castle in Märchenland-kuru!

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:21.700
Miss, I believe what Hoshizora-san is trying to say is that the answer can be found in the morals of fairy tales!

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.620
Is that not an acceptable form of answer, in its own way?

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.880
I'd appreciate if it was restricted to art class, however.{TLC: "restraining" isn't the right word here. (Perhaps was thinking of "refraining [from that outside of art class]"?) "I'd appreciate it if you kept that to art class, however." "I'd appreciate it if that were restricted to art class, however."}

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:31.780
Art? What's that-kuru? I wanna do art-kuru! I wanna-kuru, I wanna-kuru!

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:34.020
Would you stop this already?!

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:38.220
This is meant to be a social studies class!

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:43.470
That's enough, Candy. You can stop now...

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:45.030
Stop!

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:46.330
I did it-kuru!

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.460
You're overdoing it!

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:54.160
Pass, pass!

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:55.610
Dribble, dribble!

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.300
I won the race!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.300
Come back already!

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.800
Where's she going?!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.350
I'm beat...

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:08.270
Well, we got through today somehow...

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:10.070
but I can't take much more of that...

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:10.880
No more...

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:15.470
Miyuki, look-kuru! I got a nice circle from that teacher-kuru!{TLC: omfg localising, but maybe changing it to "a pretty circle" would make the joke work in English}

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:16.960
See-kuru?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.820
That's not a circle, it's a zero. Like, 0%.

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:24.190
But they gave me all these presents-kuru!

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:26.600
Those are remedial lessons!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.790
What's the matter, Miyuki-kuru...?

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.170
Just stop, alright?! Enough!

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:34.140
Do you know what you're putting me through with all your messing around?!

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:37.980
What're you getting so mad about-kuru!{TLC: "What're you getting so angry/worked up/mad about?!" is more natural English}

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.290
Come on, now...

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:42.390
Perhaps we should think of a way of righting this issue?

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:46.130
Yeah, but I ain't thinking up any bright ideas...

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:50.880
No way! Are we gonna be stuck like this forever...?{TLC: for the first bit before the gap, sug. "No way!" in front of this sentence}

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:52.740
I hope not...

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.680
It would be rather problematic.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.270
Huh? Candy...?

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:01.670
Huh?!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:06.280
Where on earth did she go?!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:09.610
So you've lost your Switchrings, you say?

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:12.320
May I ask exactly what you mean by that?

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:16.590
They're my masterpiece! My greatest creation!

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.520
You invented them? That's quite remarkable, at your age...

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:22.330
I'm not that old, you whippersnapper!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.510
To explain, my Switchrings are magic rings

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:28.030
that will switch the minds of whoever is foolish enough to wear them!

00:10:28.030 --> 00:10:31.960
Magic...? Pardon me, but what exactly is your occupation...?

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.140
I am a creator of Bad Ends!

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:36.310
Ah, I see, you're a writer!

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:37.430
What?!

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:41.160
What are you going on about?

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:48.020
There's one!

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:50.210
Wait, please come back!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.650
Madam!

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:53.350
Come back, dear!

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:56.730
Stop making me sound old! I'm still young, you know!

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:04.670
Happy!

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:11.590
Candy!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:17.720
Why did Miyuki have to get so mad at me-kuru?!

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:18.210
Kuru?

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.170
Kuru!

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:22.660
You wanna play with us?

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:25.350
Yeah-kuru!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:29.690
I wonder where Candy went off to...

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:43.360
Did you find Candy?

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:45.870
Nope. Dunno where she went.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:46.830
Alright...

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.780
So, I've been thinking...

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:56.180
Ever since Candy came to our world, she's been trying really hard, helping to find the other Precure...

00:11:56.720 --> 00:12:02.260
Even today, she was trying to help as well as she knew how...

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:06.990
I really do have to say sorry...

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.660
No time to waste, then! Let's find Candy!

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.590
We'll go look for her again, okay?{TLC: "Let's go have another look for her!" or something is probably more natural here}

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:12.600
Really?

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:14.020
Come on!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.040
I'd better look too!

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:21.310
Candy!

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:27.600
Just a bit further-kuru...

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:31.560
Too bad...

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:34.000
Narumi?

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.160
Mom!

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:37.590
Bye bye, miss!

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.590
Bye bye-kuru...

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:52.050
Miyuki was really mad at me-kuru...

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:56.060
I should go back-kuru...

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:58.410
I need to say...

00:12:58.680 --> 00:12:59.880
Now I've found you!

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:04.820
Now, be a good girl and give me back that ring!

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:11.710
You know what happens to bad girls who don't give things back?

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:14.830
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:17.800
...a Bad End!

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:22.100
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.580
I don't wanna play any more...

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:38.280
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot-sama!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:47.830
Oh, right-kuru!

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:49.900
Kuru!

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:53.890
Precure, Smile Charge-kuru!

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:59.480
Why can't I transform-kuru?!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:04.040
Kuru...? Oh, I see! You're that fairy!

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:05.850
How could you tell-kuru?!

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:10.320
Which means... oh my, well isn't this a turn for the interesting!

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:12.430
Kuru...

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:14.920
Stop right there!

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:19.500
Girls!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.430
Miyuki... you came to find me-kuru!

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:25.200
Of course I did, silly!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:27.030
There you are, Precure!

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:31.670
I'm afraid Cure Happy won't be joining you today!

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:32.860
Really?!

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:35.020
Guess we'll have to fight extra hard instead!

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.280
Ready?

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:43.620
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:44.620
Go!

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:46.860
Go, go!

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:49.080
Let's go!

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:21.450
Dazzling sun!

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:23.600
Hot-blooded power!

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:25.960
Cure Sunny!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.900
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:35.020
Cure Peace!

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:40.110
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:43.180
Cure March!

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:49.200
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:51.990
Cure Beauty!

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:58.900
Come forth, Akanbe!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:03.900
Akanbe!

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:06.230
It's tiny!

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:09.790
Don't judge a book by its cover, now! You might regret it!

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.070
Akanbe!

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:16.810
Beauty!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:22.250
Akanbe! {March can ride my horsey if you know what I mean :P}

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:28.050
Settle down already, will you?!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:29.610
Akanbe!

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:32.530
Akanbe!

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:36.130
The heck?! {I thought cure bondage was supposed to be more fun... this isn't hot as I hoped}

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:45.510
What did I tell you? Now all that remains...

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:48.950
...is to take care of you two!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:53.800
It really was a stroke of good luck that you picked up my rings!

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:55.920
So this is all your doing?!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.920
How are we meant to take these off-kuru?!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:02.220
Oh, you can't! Not without this, at least!

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:03.420
What's that...?

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:08.760
It's the only antidote capable of removing my Switchrings! I call it...

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:11.340
Backtonormal!

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:13.380
Not very imaginative.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.530
What atrocious naming sense...

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:16.800
Oh, shut up! Get them, Akanbe!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.000
Akanbe!

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:19.770
Akan?!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.640
What do you think you're doing?

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:24.210
Candy?

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:27.850
I will not let you hurt Miyuki-kuru!{TLC: "I, Miyuki, won't let you hurt her!"}

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.850
Candy, don't be reckless!

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:33.720
I'm not Candy! Right now I'm you, Miyuki-kuru!

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:36.930
You would never give up so easily-kuru!

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:40.990
You've always been there to protect me-kuru!

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:42.960
Candy...

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:47.530
You can try what you like, but without your transformation? You can't do anything!

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:49.000
Yes, she can!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.160
Miyuki?!

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:54.970
Candy's been trying so hard to try to fill in for me!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:59.450
I'm not gonna sit here and let you mock her kindness!

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:02.880
What?!

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:07.860
Miyuki...

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.950
Okay... I'll give it a try!

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:12.520
Kuru.

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.380
Candy?

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:16.930
Kuru?

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.670
I was a little too hard on you earlier.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:21.230
Sorry.

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:24.200
I'm sorry too-kuru!

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:29.850
Alright, let's do this!

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:35.110
Ready?

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:38.450
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:39.730
Go!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:41.860
Go, go!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:43.930
Let's go!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:02.690
The light of the future,

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:04.210
Shining Kuru Kuru!

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:08.000
Cure Candy!

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:12.060
It...

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.350
It worked!{TLC: just putting "We... We did it!" out there as a suggestion for Ed}

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:14.880
Cure Candy?!

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.170
Incredible!

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:20.290
What can you do with that tiny little body of yours?!

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.420
That's a good point...

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:24.740
Use your ears-kuru!

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:25.900
Got it!

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:27.070
Alright!

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:28.550
Her ears...?

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:29.300
Akanbe!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:32.910
You did it-kuru!

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:42.620
Oh, I get it...

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:46.590
You can do it, Happy! I mean, Cure Candy-kuru!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:50.280
That's the spirit, Cure Candy!

00:19:57.730 --> 00:20:01.470
What are you doing?! Just catch her already!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.340
That was a close one!

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:09.510
Now's my chance!

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:15.280
Kuru!

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:17.210
Kuru!

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:18.680
Nice catch!

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.350
Akanbe!

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:22.690
Cure Candy!

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:25.090
Akanbe!

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:31.800
Akanbe!

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:33.000
Now-kuru!

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:37.460
Precure...

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:40.650
Happy...

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:42.340
Shower!

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:53.590
Akanbe!

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.850
It's the Cherry Blossom Decor-kuru!

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:08.430
I'll get you for this!

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.410
Let's play that again!

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:21.040
Will that do it...?

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.530
We're back to normal!

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:40.090
That's a day of my life I ain't gonna forget...

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:42.500
It was rather fun, though!

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:45.090
Maybe we should have left them like that a bit longer...

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:46.350
Please, no!

00:21:46.350 --> 00:21:47.910
Thought so...

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:50.860
Guess I have those remedial lessons to do tonight...

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:52.930
I'll help you do them-kuru!

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:54.480
As long as you actually help this time...

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:55.980
You can trust me-kuru!

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:59.290
Alright, then let's blitz through them!

00:21:59.390 --> 00:22:00.940
Kuru!

00:23:44.550 --> 00:23:46.600
Candy! Today is April´s Fool!

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:48.200
It´s the day when everyone plays pranks!

00:23:48.200 --> 00:23:49.800
And why do you play pranks-kuru?

00:23:49.800 --> 00:23:51.520
Miyuki-chan! Listen...

00:23:51.520 --> 00:23:52.850
What´s wrong Yayoi-chan?

00:23:52.850 --> 00:23:55.600
You see... I am transferring schools!

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:57.500
WHAAAAAAAAT!?

00:23:57.500 --> 00:23:59.500
It can´t be! Everyone we have a problem!

00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:02.650
Wait Miyuki-chan! I was just kidding!!

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:04.700
Smile Precure!

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:09.500
Everyone's smiling and ultra happy!
